@Admin @User-two user modes
Functional Requirement:
1. Adding/uploading a question                @Admin
2. Adding a quiz                              @Admin
3. Starting an attempt                        @User
4. Keep attempts non concurrent for a user    @User


Api:
1. @PostMapping("/user/{topicId}")
        expects- QuestionDTO in Json(Question - (questionId and topicId) )
        returns-ResponseEntity

2.@PostMapping("/admin/quiz")
        expects- QuizDTO in json (Quiz - quizID)
        returns- ResponseEntity

3.@PostMapping("/start/{quizID}")
        expects- quizID in long
        returns- AttemptDTO
        AttemptDTO{
        attemptID:long, -1 means null, look at other value and start a new quiz
        completedQuiz: boolean, true means quiz is over for you
        }

4.@PostMapping("/quiz/{attemptID}")
        expects- questionDTO (solved)
        returns- questionDTO (next unsolved ones)
        QuestionDTO{
                  String question;
                    String option1;
                    String option2;
                    String option3;
                    String option4;
                    Boolean isMCQ=true;
        }
5. @GetMapping("/quiz/{attemptID}/heartbeat")
        expects-attemptID
        return-nothing
        updates the lastActivity

6.@PostMapping("/admin/dashboard")
        expects-nothing
        returns-listOf(quiz), order by Latest creation, 10 at max

7.@PostMapping("/admin/{quizID}")
        expects-quizID
        return-ListOf(AttemptDTO), order by recents
        AttemptDTO{
                long attemptID;
                int score;
                boolean completedQuiz;
        }

8.@PostMapping("/admin/{attemptID}")
        excepts- attemptID
        return-listOf(questions), questions grouped by attemptID

9.@PostMapping("/user/dashboard")
        expects-nothing
        returns-listOf(quiz) , order by desc attemptsLeft, 10 at max; that we have given

10.@PostMapping("/admin/{quizID}")
        expects-quizID
        return-ListOf(AttemptDTO), order by recents
        AttemptDTO{
                long attemptID;
                int score;
                boolean completedQuiz;
        }

11.@PostMapping("/user/{attemptID}")
        excepts- attemptID
        return-listOf(questions), questions grouped by attemptID


Entity:
1. Question
            long questionID;
            String topicId;
            String question;
            String option1;
            String option2;
            String option3;
            String option4;
            Boolean isMCQ=true;
            ArrayList<String> correct;
2.Quiz
                long quizID;
                String topicId;
                int numberOfQuestion;
                int timeLimit; //in minutes
                int correct=1;
                int wrong=0;
                int notAttended=0;
                int attempts;
3.Attempt
                long attemptID;
                long quizID;
                String userID;
                private Instant lastActivity;//in minutes
                Boolean hasSubmitted=false;
                int idle;//in minutes
                int seed;//value of range(1,24)
                private Instant startedAt;

4.History
                long attemptID;
                long questionID;
                boolean solved;
                int answer;// range 1,4 inclusive
                int seq;//during saving this i will store the sequence

Exceptions:
1. CannotCreateTransactionException.class = for transactional
2. DataAccessResourceFailureException.class = in general if fails this will be triggered

---------------------------------------------------------------
to improve efficiency of the db,

1.    CREATE INDEX idx_history_attempt_solved_seq
      ON history (attemptid, solved, seq);

